 `conversation.input.activity` hosts one control between the model selector and Send. Its `onActiveChange` callback expands that control across the toolbar and hides ordinary accessory controls and the context meter while preserving the editor and submit action. Closing the activity restores those controls with context details closed. The empty hero dock remains collapsed when it has no content. The occupant releases expansion on unmount and owns any activity-specific feedback.
 
 <a id="model-experience"></a>
+## Single-directory desktop builds
+
+In [single-directory desktop builds](../ui-workspace/README.md), blank conversations omit the workspace selector while retaining the Composer, model selection, attachments, and agent preset controls.
+
+## Bloop companion
+
+Bloop builds replace the blank headline and preset row with an animated companion and one of twelve locale-owned greetings. The same avatar stays mounted while the first message moves it from above the composer to the upper-left corner; its animation clock continues. The composer omits the permission chip while permission enforcement and slash commands remain active. The system reduced-motion preference freezes the decorative animation. The bundled bloub engine retains its MIT license and source revision in `src/client/bloop/LICENSE.bloub` and `NOTICE.bloub`; the React adapter cycles twelve poses with SVG rings and particles. A gentle continuous sway keeps held poses visibly animated. Position and scale share one 1.3-second compositor transform. The Bloop conversation omits the session title, view tabs, and header utility controls; delivered-file cards still open previews.
+
+The Bloop attachment button uses a paperclip icon and opens the file picker directly; it keeps the standard upload validation and error reporting.
+
 ## Model Experience
 
 None, as this package renders browser state and sends user-admitted inputs through Session Controller APIs without constructing model requests.
