+## Single-directory desktop builds
+
+In [single-directory desktop builds](../ui-workspace/README.md), global panels move to the footer Tools menu; panel registrations and plugin activation remain unchanged.
+
+## Bloop controls
+
+Bloop builds omit the build badge, brand row, and Tools shortcut. The creation button reads New Task in English and 新对话 in Chinese. Existing settings and plugin capabilities remain registered. Hover-history geometry belongs to [ui-layout](../ui-layout/README.md).
+
 ## Model Experience
 
 None, as the package is a browser-side UI plugin layer that registers nothing model-facing.
